  activity at sea. Nature. https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06825-8

Changes in this version:
  - Public Earth Engine water masks replace private GFW assets; the shore
    buffer is computed on the fly (detector/core/gee.py).
  - Scene search restricted to named regions (detector/core/detector.py,
    detector/core/regions.py, detector/config.yaml).
  - Fixed the composite (infrastructure) detector, which referenced
    undefined variables.
  - Detections loaded into PostgreSQL/PostGIS instead of BigQuery
    (detector/load_detections.py, sql/schema.sql).
  - Vessels separated from fixed infrastructure in PostGIS
    (detector/flag_infrastructure.py).
  - Command-line interfaces for the detection scripts.
  - Removed: deep learning models (nnets/), paper analyses (analysis/),
    AIS/VMS matching in BigQuery, footprint and shoreline detectors.

Modified files say so in their header.
